  "live_records": {
    "q-49576": {
      "dom_id": "step-q49576",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Calculate $\\int \\frac{x}{1-3{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.$",
      "worked_solution": "Let $u=1-3{x}^{2}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-6x\\,⟹\\,(-\\frac{1}{6})\\text{d}u=x\\,\\text{d}x,\n$$\n\nand we can solve the resulting integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{x}{1-3{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{1-3{x}^{2}}\\cdot x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{6})\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{6}\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|1-3{x}^{2}|+C\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
